      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "Among Cubs’ 5 Gold Glove finalists, CF Pete Crow-Armstrong & 3B Alex Bregman win NL GG award at respective positions. Brewers LF Jackson Chourio prevented Ian Happ from winning 5th straight, Dbacks RF Corbin Carroll & SS Geraldo Perdomo take it over Seiya Suzuki & Dansby Swanson",
      "likes": 26,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-02T02:26:01.204Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:nbtbg72x4ai35yy2mmx4o2mb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzcbiyy4as2g",
      "jp_players": [
        "Seiya Suzuki",
        "Suzuki"
      ],
      "jp": "カブスのゴールドグラブ最終候補5人のうち、中堅手ピート・クロウ=アームストロングと三塁手アレックス・ブレグマンがナ・リーグ受賞。ブルワーズのチョーリオがハップの5年連続を阻止、D-backsのキャロルとペルドモが鈴木誠也とスワンソンを抑えた"
    },
    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Tanner Bibee has won the AL Gold Glove Award at pitcher. Second Cleveland pitcher to win the honor, joining Shane Bieber in 2022.",
      "likes": 49,
      "reposts": 8,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-02T01:45:35.788Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:jrwmzzblbtbegomwff262gv4/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzc7apw6z22m",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Well, this is awkward.",
          "likes": 3,
          "author": "medi-nerd.com"
        },
        {
          "text": "Self defense",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "solana77.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "He deserves it. Controls the run game better than anyone, and even catches his own popups!",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "owenwro.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "タナー・ビービーがア・リーグの投手部門でゴールドグラブ賞を受賞。クリーブランドの投手では2022年のシェーン・ビーバー以来2人目"
    },
    {
      "handle": "jasonbeck.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jason Beck",
      "team": "タイガース",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Dillon Dingler has won the AL Gold Glove award at catcher, again. He joins Iván Rodríguez (2006-07), Lance Parrish (1983-85) and Bill Freehan (1965-69) as Tigers catchers to win back-to-back Gold Gloves.",
      "likes": 44,
      "reposts": 9,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-02T01:42:53.444Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:ug2irz5m3k7nlbpiggqc73wt/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzc73v3tx22l",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ディロン・ディングラーがア・リーグ捕手部門で再びゴールドグラブ賞を受賞。タイガースの捕手による連続受賞は、イバン・ロドリゲス（2006-07年）、ランス・パリッシュ（1983-85年）、ビル・フリーハン（1965-69年）に続く4人目"
    },
    {
      "handle": "bastianmlb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jordan Bastian",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Pete Crow-Armstrong takes home his 2nd career National League Gold Glove in center field. • +26 Fielding Run Value -- highest under Statcast (since 2016) for an outfielder in one season • +26 Outs Above Average -- tied Byron Buxton (2017) for most under Statcast in one season",
      "likes": 44,
      "reposts": 6,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-02T02:15:15.281Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:rcetk47n6hybe57ou4m36jf6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzcavqxz5c2v",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ピート・クロウ=アームストロングが中堅手部門で通算2度目のナ・リーグ・ゴールドグラブ賞。・守備での得点価値+26はStatcast導入後（2016年以降）の外野手の1シーズンで最高 ・OAA+26は1シーズンとしてStatcast導入後でバクストン（2017年）と並び最多"
    },
    {
      "handle": "chandlerrome.bsky.social",
      "author": "Chandler Rome",
      "team": "アストロズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "Christian Walker won his fourth career Gold Glove.",
      "likes": 34,
      "reposts": 5,
