      "jp": "クリスチャン・ウォーカーが通算4度目のゴールドグラブ賞を受賞"
    },
    {
      "handle": "bastianmlb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jordan Bastian",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Alex Bregman (+7 Fielding Run Value, +9 Outs Above Average and +15 Defensive Runs Saved) takes home a Gold Glove Award at third base in the National League. It's his second career win ('24 with Astros). Bregman joins Ron Santo as the only Gold Glove winners at 3B for the Cubs.",
      "likes": 33,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-02T01:53:55.103Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:rcetk47n6hybe57ou4m36jf6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzc7pm43cs2u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "アレックス・ブレグマン（守備での得点価値+7、OAA+9、DRS+15）がナ・リーグの三塁手部門でゴールドグラブ賞。2024年のアストロズ時代に続き通算2度目。カブスの三塁手での受賞はロン・サントに次ぎ2人目"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "The #BlueJays had five finalists for Gold Glove Awards, but no winners tonight. I thought Vladimir Guerrero Jr. had the best shot. In a very bad year, his defence was very good. Brandon Valenzuela’s defensive metrics were excellent, but playing time could be a factor.",
      "likes": 31,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-02T02:14:44.032Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzcaut6ek22c",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "#BlueJays はゴールドグラブ賞の最終候補が5人いたが、今夜の受賞者はなし。最有力はブラディミール・ゲレーロJr.だと思っていた。大不振の1年で、守備は非常に良かった。ブランドン・バレンズエラの守備指標は優秀だったが、出場機会が響いたかも"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "José Soriano, Andrés Giménez and Nathan Lukes were the #BlueJays’ other Gold Glove finalists. I was glad to see Lukes get some recognition as a finalist. His throwing from the outfield, in particular, was just so damn good in 2026.",
      "likes": 28,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-02T02:14:57.966Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzcavahlxk2c",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ホセ・ソリアーノ、アンドレス・ヒメネス、ネイサン・ルークスもBlueJaysの最終候補だった。ルークスが最終候補として評価されたのは嬉しい。特に外野からの送球は2026年、本当に素晴らしかった"
    }
  ],
